      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MOCAMBORA MITCH (6) struggled in tougher grade last start after settling well back at this track, but prior to that won by 0.8 lengths at this track (17.87) beating Dorset in a Maiden on August 23. Has claims if he runs up to expectations. GLIMMER OF HOPE (2) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 305m behind PUDDIN' CAKE (18.54) in a TG1-4W. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from seven starts. Has the ability to give this a shake. LITTLE BUTTON (4) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by a nose at this track in a handy 17.96 beating Saint Kylie. Comes through a solid form race last start. Sure to be thereabouts. PUDDIN' CAKE (1) is another with top-three prospects.",
